262
00:19:01.350 --> 00:19:02.434
Okay.

263
00:19:12.027 --> 00:19:13.028
Morning.

264
00:19:15.739 --> 00:19:17.574
What happened? You okay?

265
00:19:18.283 --> 00:19:19.701
Yeah. I'm fine. Why?

266
00:19:21.620 --> 00:19:24.540
I waited till the kitchen closed.
You never came back.

267
00:19:32.589 --> 00:19:34.508
- Hi. Hi.
- Hi. Catherine.

268
00:19:34.591 --> 00:19:35.676
How you doing. Cat?

269
00:19:36.510 --> 00:19:38.720
Beyond being charged with
killing my husband?

270
00:19:39.263 --> 00:19:40.681
Just got a nice pedicure.

271
00:19:41.348 --> 00:19:43.725
Right. Have a seat.

272
00:19:46.311 --> 00:19:48.814
I'd like to start by talking about
the preliminary hearing.

273
00:19:48.897 --> 00:19:51.900
Looks like there are eight cases
ahead of you.

274
00:19:51.984 --> 00:19:54.069
- Five.
- Yeah.

275
00:19:54.820 --> 00:19:57.239
Five. which actually means
we'll probably go on the 19th.

276
00:20:00.158 --> 00:20:01.827
You seem a little distracted.

277
00:20:03.579 --> 00:20:04.955
Yeah. well. family stuff.

278
00:20:05.038 --> 00:20:07.291
- But don't worry. I'm locked in.
- Okay. good.

279
00:20:08.000 --> 00:20:10.711
My husband. rest his soul.
he got distracted.

280
00:20:11.587 --> 00:20:12.963
By our nanny. Yadira.

281
00:20:14.173 --> 00:20:15.716
And by my best friend Cindy.

282
00:20:16.675 --> 00:20:19.428
And as near as I can make out.
at least four other women

283
00:20:19.511 --> 00:20:23.724
and a particularly charming young man
he met at the Crosswinds Golf Club.

284
00:20:23.807 --> 00:20:24.850
You know it?

285
00:20:25.893 --> 00:20:27.060
Yeah. I just…

286
00:20:27.561 --> 00:20:29.354
I don't want you distracted. Tom.

287
00:20:29.938 --> 00:20:31.023
What are you saying?

288
00:20:31.106 --> 00:20:33.317
Well. I'm just saying…

289
00:20:33.901 --> 00:20:35.485
I think you're distracted by her.

290
00:20:37.571 --> 00:20:38.822
I want her off my case.

291
00:20:49.041 --> 00:20:52.961
I didn't want to say this by phone.
but you have a cloud over your head.

292
00:20:53.045 --> 00:20:54.796
- I know...
- Assault?

293
00:20:54.880 --> 00:20:56.924
He is after my family. Noa.

294
00:20:57.007 --> 00:20:58.800
I get that you think that.

295
00:21:00.093 --> 00:21:03.055
Paloma will be taking your place
at the upcoming hearing.

296
00:21:03.138 --> 00:21:05.516
- Come on.
- Work from home until this is over.

297
00:21:05.599 --> 00:21:06.934
That's not right.

298
00:21:07.017 --> 00:21:08.644
It's not about what's right.

299
00:21:08.727 --> 00:21:10.521
it's about how it looks.

300
00:21:10.604 --> 00:21:11.813
Remember that.

301
00:21:31.166 --> 00:21:34.211
Yo. she just bounced up like
a mountain goat. Like a mountain goat.

302
00:21:34.294 --> 00:21:36.964
Like a. like a. like a.
like a mountain goat. mountain goat.

303
00:21:37.047 --> 00:21:38.549
like a mountain goat…

304
00:22:00.779 --> 00:22:02.239
What's next… I…

305
00:22:08.871 --> 00:22:10.247
What are you doing in here?

306
00:22:15.002 --> 00:22:16.003
What is that?

307
00:22:18.338 --> 00:22:20.299
You still have all nine toes. right?

308
00:22:24.136 --> 00:22:25.137
Hey.

309
00:22:27.806 --> 00:22:28.807
Talk to me.

310
00:22:29.558 --> 00:22:30.893
I'm not Mom and Tom.

311
00:23:05.219 --> 00:23:06.678
What the fuck?

312
00:23:06.762 --> 00:23:08.847
I thought I smelled bullshit.

313
00:23:08.931 --> 00:23:10.974
You started drinking early today?

314
00:23:11.058 --> 00:23:13.101
You fucking piece of shit.

315
00:23:14.394 --> 00:23:17.564
You want everyone to hate you
so you can feel like a victim?

316
00:23:18.190 --> 00:23:20.817
You're not. And we don't. okay?

317
00:23:21.610 --> 00:23:24.613
I think you're just not sure
how to love me anymore.

318
00:23:27.115 --> 00:23:28.450
Right?

319
00:23:28.534 --> 00:23:29.743
Why are you saying that?

320
00:23:44.675 --> 00:23:47.261
That's what you told our mutual friend.

321
00:23:53.517 --> 00:23:55.102
Stop talking! Fuck you!

322
00:23:55.185 --> 00:23:58.397
- Nat. stop! Stop. Nat!
- Zack. stop! Stop moving.

323
00:23:59.231 --> 00:24:01.400
I'll kill you.
I'm gonna fucking kill you. Stop.

324
00:24:01.483 --> 00:24:03.735
- Hey! Hey. get off of him!
- Get off!

325
00:24:03.819 --> 00:24:05.279
What are you doing?

326
00:24:05.362 --> 00:24:07.447
- Hey.
- Fuck.

327
00:24:07.531 --> 00:24:10.284
- She just attacked me.
- I truly fucking hate you.

328
00:24:10.367 --> 00:24:13.954
She's mad about her girlfriend.
She's mad about her.

329
00:24:17.708 --> 00:24:19.626
I told you not to talk
to Zack about Nevaeh.

330
00:24:19.710 --> 00:24:22.045
Right. 'Cause you love having secrets.

331
00:24:22.129 --> 00:24:24.006
- don't you?
- What is that supposed to mean?

332
00:24:28.093 --> 00:24:29.887
Why does Max actually hate you?

333
00:24:33.098 --> 00:24:34.600
Because he went to prison.

334
00:24:34.683 --> 00:24:37.477
For a murder he didn't commit. right?

335
00:24:40.772 --> 00:24:42.608
I thought he did kill his wife.

336
00:24:44.193 --> 00:24:46.695
Maybe I still do. but I represented him.

337
00:24:48.947 --> 00:24:49.948
Okay. Mom.

338
00:24:59.666 --> 00:25:00.667
What is that?

339
00:25:01.710 --> 00:25:04.671
I don't know. I found it by the garage.

340
00:25:20.896 --> 00:25:23.982
Clients have an absolute right
to determine who represents 'em.

341
00:25:24.066 --> 00:25:26.527
And you have an absolute right
to tell her to go fuck herself.

342
00:25:27.236 --> 00:25:29.947
Lex. I can get you
on some great cases. all right?

343
00:25:30.030 --> 00:25:31.430
This case was gonna help my career.

344
00:25:31.490 --> 00:25:32.950
Besides. I've done most of the work.

345
00:25:33.450 --> 00:25:35.452
Senior associates
always do most of the work.

346
00:25:35.536 --> 00:25:37.454
And then get kicked off cases
for no reason?

347
00:25:37.538 --> 00:25:38.539
Hey.

348
00:25:39.373 --> 00:25:41.583
Are you acting this way
'cause we had a moment?

349
00:25:43.669 --> 00:25:45.379
You kissing me wasn't a moment.

350
00:25:46.088 --> 00:25:47.089
Okay. Tom.

351
00:25:47.673 --> 00:25:50.509
We're just gonna pretend like
we weren't building up to that together.

352
00:25:54.054 --> 00:25:56.765
Hey. you have Catherine's trust.

353
00:25:56.849 --> 00:25:58.225
You can sway her.

354
00:25:58.308 --> 00:26:02.104
Or maybe I'll lose her trust
and we lose her as a client.

355
00:26:02.187 --> 00:26:04.481
The only thing she wants
more than you representing her

356
00:26:04.565 --> 00:26:07.442
is you bending her over
our conference table.

357
00:26:07.526 --> 00:26:09.820
- Well. that's inappropriate.
- I'm inappropriate?

358
00:26:10.571 --> 00:26:11.655
Look in the mirror.

359
00:26:12.573 --> 00:26:15.909
All the flirting and the gaslighting.

360
00:26:16.618 --> 00:26:18.495
Don't get me started on the microdosing.

361
00:26:19.079 --> 00:26:20.330
You gave that to me.

362
00:26:20.414 --> 00:26:22.791
You're my boss.
You shouldn't have taken it.

363
00:26:25.252 --> 00:26:26.253
You know.

364
00:26:26.837 --> 00:26:29.923
I'm not the type of person that would

365
00:26:30.966 --> 00:26:34.219
threaten to tell your partners
or your wife.

366
00:26:34.303 --> 00:26:35.512
Are you threatening me?

367
00:26:35.596 --> 00:26:38.765
Didn't you hear
what I literally just said? I'm not.

368
00:26:39.725 --> 00:26:44.813
I'm just talking about the inevitable
result of an HR investigation.

369
00:26:48.400 --> 00:26:49.610
I need to think about this.

370
00:26:50.194 --> 00:26:53.614
Yeah. You do. Don't take your time.

371
00:27:01.330 --> 00:27:04.708
Since he got out.
bad things keep happening.

372
00:27:05.417 --> 00:27:09.963
It's obvious. he is using that girl
as a Trojan horse

373
00:27:10.047 --> 00:27:14.676
to gain influence over my children.
to turn them against us.

374
00:27:15.177 --> 00:27:17.054
You want me to investigate Max Cady?

375
00:27:17.137 --> 00:27:19.181
Okay. we have to find Nevaeh.

376
00:27:19.264 --> 00:27:21.558
We should start with her mother. Faith.

377
00:27:21.642 --> 00:27:23.393
You know I love Zack and Nat.

378
00:27:24.520 --> 00:27:25.854
And I owe you everything.

379
00:27:27.773 --> 00:27:30.609
And you saved my life.
Now you've got to trust me.

380
00:27:31.235 --> 00:27:32.611
Leave this to the cops.

381
00:27:33.904 --> 00:27:36.573
You're gonna lose your job. Or worse.

382
00:27:37.074 --> 00:27:39.201
Fuck it. I'll do it myself.

383
00:27:39.284 --> 00:27:41.411
- I can find this girl on my own.
- Hey.

384
00:28:19.533 --> 00:28:21.201
Faith. My name is...

385
00:28:21.285 --> 00:28:23.370
Well. I've seen you somewhere.

386
00:28:24.371 --> 00:28:27.708
Was it that video
where you got my girl hit by a car?

387
00:28:30.460 --> 00:28:31.461
I'm sorry.

388
00:28:32.629 --> 00:28:37.050
Look. I overreacted. but I'm just
a mom whose kids are in danger. like you.

389
00:28:40.095 --> 00:28:43.599
I think your daughter is being manipulated
by Max Cady and if you help me.

390
00:28:44.183 --> 00:28:47.311
we can put him back in jail
and get your daughter home.

391
00:28:55.110 --> 00:28:56.445
Don't you come back here.

392
00:29:07.998 --> 00:29:11.001
Tom. it's been a long time
since you were a prosecutor.

393
00:29:11.084 --> 00:29:12.085
Let me remind you

394
00:29:12.169 --> 00:29:15.297
that killing uncomfortable questions
before they get asked

395
00:29:15.380 --> 00:29:17.799
is a… it's way better
for your blood pressure.

396
00:29:17.883 --> 00:29:22.179
So. just do what Lexi wants
is what you're saying?

397
00:29:22.262 --> 00:29:23.263
Well…

398
00:29:23.764 --> 00:29:24.890
Feels like blackmail.

399
00:29:24.973 --> 00:29:27.434
If the alternative is an HR investigation…

400
00:29:28.393 --> 00:29:29.686
Excuse me. gentlemen.

401
00:29:31.104 --> 00:29:32.147
Tom.

402
00:29:34.149 --> 00:29:38.403
I just wanna say thank you again
for hearing me out earlier.

403
00:29:39.071 --> 00:29:40.113
No problem.

404
00:29:40.697 --> 00:29:42.074
Sorry if I got heated.

405
00:29:43.033 --> 00:29:47.579
but being wrongly accused.
it's a sore spot. you know?

406
00:29:47.663 --> 00:29:49.164
Anyway. you're a good man.

407
00:29:54.670 --> 00:29:56.713
Killed his wife. Didn't kill his wife.

408
00:29:56.797 --> 00:29:58.674
He's an arrogant bastard either way.

409
00:29:59.883 --> 00:30:01.593
Why do women like guys like that?

410
00:30:03.387 --> 00:30:04.763
I don't feel bad we put him away.

411
00:30:05.722 --> 00:30:07.474
I gotta go. I got this.

412
00:30:08.725 --> 00:30:09.726
Thanks.

413
00:30:10.310 --> 00:30:11.395
Thank you.

414
00:30:18.277 --> 00:30:19.611
What's your poison?

415
00:30:32.499 --> 00:30:34.459
Armed. Stay.

416
00:30:48.557 --> 00:30:49.600
Zack?

417
00:31:01.570 --> 00:31:02.571
Zack?

418
00:31:04.948 --> 00:31:06.033
What are you doing?

419
00:31:12.998 --> 00:31:13.999
Nothing.

420
00:31:15.459 --> 00:31:16.460
You feeling okay?

421
00:31:33.101 --> 00:31:34.102
I love you. Ma.

422
00:31:51.078 --> 00:31:52.079
I was wrong.

423
00:31:53.622 --> 00:31:55.874
It's not Max you're scared of. it's Nevaeh.

424
00:31:59.336 --> 00:32:01.171
You don't want your daughter back.

425
00:32:07.094 --> 00:32:10.097
Must be strange switching sides. no?

426
00:32:12.224 --> 00:32:13.684
Yeah. it's more abstract.

427
00:32:14.476 --> 00:32:16.728
representing the people.

428
00:32:16.812 --> 00:32:18.522
Now my clients are real people.

429
00:32:19.106 --> 00:32:22.109
Right. And you're dealing
with a tough case now?

430
00:32:24.736 --> 00:32:27.656
What do you mean?
The Catherine Buckley case?

431
00:32:30.951 --> 00:32:32.828
No… What do I know?

432
00:32:32.911 --> 00:32:34.329
It's just that I see…

433
00:32:36.957 --> 00:32:38.959
I see something eating at you.

434
00:32:40.169 --> 00:32:41.920
Am I wrong. Counselor?

435
00:32:44.882 --> 00:32:45.966
Well. it's just a…

436
00:32:47.467 --> 00:32:49.094
Conflict with a colleague.

437
00:32:49.678 --> 00:32:53.557
I wouldn't call it coercion.
but I'm being pressured.

438
00:32:55.726 --> 00:32:57.144
And what are you gonna do?

439
00:32:59.730 --> 00:33:00.731
I don't know.

440
00:33:02.274 --> 00:33:03.775
Do you have a hero. Tom?

441
00:33:06.403 --> 00:33:07.404
A hero?

442
00:33:07.487 --> 00:33:09.781
A hero. a hero. Someone who inspired you.

443
00:33:09.865 --> 00:33:10.991
Someone that.

444
00:33:11.575 --> 00:33:14.536
I don't know. it could be a coach
or someone in the army.

445
00:33:15.287 --> 00:33:16.663
- Marines.
- Marines.

446
00:33:17.789 --> 00:33:21.460
The example of what it means to be
a good person. You have that?

447
00:33:24.338 --> 00:33:26.548
My older brother. Nathan.

448
00:33:29.885 --> 00:33:31.762
What would Nathan tell you to do?

449
00:33:34.139 --> 00:33:37.059
I guess. "Do the right thing."

450
00:33:37.142 --> 00:33:41.522
Exactly. to stand up for yourself. Right?
To be a man.

451
00:33:44.525 --> 00:33:45.943
I mean. what does that even mean?

452
00:33:46.026 --> 00:33:49.446
Well. lots of things.

453
00:33:51.198 --> 00:33:53.075
Let me ask you another question. sir.

454
00:33:54.535 --> 00:33:55.869
Okay.

455
00:33:55.953 --> 00:33:57.621
What is your worst fear?

456
00:34:01.917 --> 00:34:04.628
Same as everyone's.
Something happening to my kids.

457
00:34:04.711 --> 00:34:09.132
No. something you had
or you felt before having kids.

458
00:34:10.050 --> 00:34:12.094
Something that's always been there.
What is it?

459
00:34:12.803 --> 00:34:14.137
I mean…

460
00:34:18.516 --> 00:34:20.268
I know what it is.

461
00:34:20.351 --> 00:34:21.687
- I can tell.
- You do?

462
00:34:21.770 --> 00:34:24.063
- Yeah. I can tell.
- Well. please.

463
00:34:24.147 --> 00:34:26.859
Well. I can tell
what you're afraid of. It's…

464
00:34:27.525 --> 00:34:28.527
Are you ready?

465
00:34:34.699 --> 00:34:35.701
Entropy.

466
00:34:39.454 --> 00:34:41.415
Chaos. Disorder.

467
00:34:41.498 --> 00:34:42.666
Collapse.

468
00:34:43.458 --> 00:34:45.043
I know what entropy is.

469
00:34:45.127 --> 00:34:47.670
Of course you do.
Because you're fucking terrified of it.

470
00:34:49.422 --> 00:34:50.424
It's obvious.

471
00:34:52.009 --> 00:34:55.762
But of all people.
you need to lose control sometime.

472
00:34:57.598 --> 00:34:59.266
Because that life you're leading…

473
00:35:02.519 --> 00:35:04.188
Something inside you is dying.

474
00:35:24.082 --> 00:35:26.293
You should pay me
for this session. Counselor.

475
00:35:27.753 --> 00:35:29.880
Shit. this place is dying too.

476
00:35:32.716 --> 00:35:33.800
Let's get out of here.

477
00:35:35.677 --> 00:35:37.596
Couple of months after we got caught.

478
00:35:38.180 --> 00:35:39.973
I got word to him that I was pregnant.

479
00:35:40.057 --> 00:35:43.727
but I guess I wasn't much
use to him anymore.

480
00:35:43.810 --> 00:35:47.397
no longer working for
the Department of Corrections.

481
00:35:48.357 --> 00:35:49.608
Did he do that to you?

482
00:35:50.234 --> 00:35:51.485
The black eye?

483
00:35:52.402 --> 00:35:53.403
Max?

484
00:35:54.363 --> 00:35:56.615
No. no. I haven't seen him in years.

485
00:35:58.951 --> 00:35:59.993
This was Nevvy.

486
00:36:00.869 --> 00:36:02.746
And you have no idea where she is?

487
00:36:03.580 --> 00:36:04.915
No. No.

488
00:36:05.666 --> 00:36:07.668
I didn't even call her in missing.

489
00:36:09.044 --> 00:36:10.587
She called herself in.

490
00:36:11.839 --> 00:36:13.423
She wanted me to be a suspect.

491
00:36:14.174 --> 00:36:17.052
He's got his claws deep in her.
just like he got 'em in me.

492
00:36:17.719 --> 00:36:20.889
He's just got this
special power over people.

493
00:36:22.516 --> 00:36:27.312
She used to video call him
with burners. from Tarwater.

494
00:36:31.859 --> 00:36:33.193
He was changing her.

495
00:36:33.277 --> 00:36:34.486
Sorry.

496
00:36:36.989 --> 00:36:41.827
All I know for sure
is they talked about his religion.

497
00:36:42.870 --> 00:36:44.413
One he created himself.

498
00:36:47.666 --> 00:36:50.919
He got her into it. It's the devil's work.

499
00:36:55.007 --> 00:36:59.511
You and I. we're the only people
who know who Max really is.

500
00:37:00.596 --> 00:37:02.723
I need you to give me something.

501
00:37:04.141 --> 00:37:08.061
If you can just tell me where she is.
then we can get her to admit

502
00:37:08.145 --> 00:37:09.605
that Max was grooming her.

503
00:37:10.480 --> 00:37:13.317
Right? And then
we can get Max sent to prison.

504
00:37:13.400 --> 00:37:15.777
And we can get Nevaeh the help
that she needs.

505
00:37:21.491 --> 00:37:23.035
I know where she sleeps.

506
00:37:25.120 --> 00:37:26.163
I'll tell you.

507
00:37:26.705 --> 00:37:28.832
Don't tell anyone I've been talking to you.

508
00:37:29.499 --> 00:37:32.794
I don't want her to know. and
I definitely don't want her to tell Max.

509
00:37:32.878 --> 00:37:33.879
Okay.

510
00:37:44.139 --> 00:37:45.140
Get that a lot?

511
00:37:48.810 --> 00:37:49.811
I'm…

512
00:37:50.312 --> 00:37:52.940
I'm not looking
for a different woman every night.

513
00:37:53.023 --> 00:37:54.149
No.

514
00:37:54.233 --> 00:37:56.401
No. I want a family.

515
00:37:57.611 --> 00:37:58.862
So. tell me. man.

516
00:37:58.946 --> 00:38:01.698
how do I meet a great woman?

517
00:38:02.199 --> 00:38:03.700
Like you did. How?

518
00:38:05.452 --> 00:38:06.453
Easy.

519
00:38:06.995 --> 00:38:09.498
Go to law school. become an ADA.

520
00:38:10.666 --> 00:38:12.167
get on a giant case.

521
00:38:13.877 --> 00:38:17.965
Counselor. Shit. I wish we'd met
